      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    face_value = 100.0\n    annual_coupon_rate = 0.05\n    coupon_payment = face_value * annual_coupon_rate\n    z_spread = 0.0234\n    spot_rates = [0.0486, 0.0495, 0.0565]\n    \n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    bond_value = 0.0\n    \n    for year, spot_rate in enumerate(spot_rates, start=1):\n        discount_rate = spot_rate + z_spread\n        cash_flow = coupon_payment\n        \n        if year == len(spot_rates):\n            cash_flow += face_value\n        \n        bond_value += cash_flow / ((1 + discount_rate) ** year)\n    \n    # return answer\n    return round(bond_value, 3)\n```",
